# Copy this file to `diagnose.env` (which is gitignored) and fill in a FRESH token.
# Then run:  node diagnose-whatsapp.mjs   (the run command auto-loads diagnose.env)
#
# Get a fresh token from Graph API Explorer (app 922638690822787) or a System User,
# with scopes: whatsapp_business_management + whatsapp_business_messaging.
# Tokens are 24h temporary — regenerate per session.

